    "ls|LS16_S12_U_427": "भारत सरकार\n \nकृ\u0000ष एवं \u0000कसान क\u0000 या\nण मं\u0000ालय\n \nकृ\u0000ष\n, \nसहका\u0000रता एवं \u0000कसान क\u0000 या\nण \u0000वभाग\n \nलोक सभा\n \nअतारां\u0000कत \u0000\u0000 न\n सं\u0000 या\n \n427\n \n18 \nजुलाई\n, \n2017\n \nको उ\u0000 त\nराथ\u0000\n \n \n\u0000वषय\n:\n \nरबी फसल\u0000 का बुआई\n-\n\u0000े\u0000\n \n427\n. \n \n\u0000ीमती आर॰ वनरोजाः\n \n\u0000या कृ\u0000ष और \u0000कसान क\u0000याण मं\u0000ी यह बताने\n \nक\u0000 \nकृपा कर\u0000गे \u0000कः\n \n \n(\nक\n)\n \n\u0000या \n26 \nनव\u0000बर\n, \n2016 \nक\u0000 ि\u0000थ\u0000त के\n \nअनुसार रबी फसल\u0000 का कुल बुआई \u0000े\u0000 गत \nवष\u0000\n \nक\u0000 संगत अव\u0000ध क\u0000 त ुलना म\u0000 अ\u0000धक है और य\u0000द\n \nहां\n, \nतो त\u0000संबंधी \u0000यौरा \u0000या \nहै\n;\n \n(\nख\n)\n \n\u0000या उ\u0000त अव\u0000ध के दौरान \u0000वम ु\u0000\u0000करण\n \nने रबी फसल\u0000 क\u0000 ब ुआई को \u0000भा\u0000वत नह\u0000ं \n\u0000कया\n \nहै\n; \nऔर\n \n(\nग\n)\n \nय\u0000द हां\n, \nतो त\u0000संबंधी \u0000यौरा \u0000या है\n?\n \n \nउ\u0000 त\nर\n \nकृ\u0000ष एवं \u0000कसान क\u0000 या\nण मं\u0000ालय म\u0000 रा\u0000 य\n मं\u0000ी\n \n(\n\u0000ी एस\n. \nएस\n. \nअहलुवा\u0000लया\n)\n \n \n(\nक\n) \nसे \n(\nग\n): \nजी\n,\n \nहां। \u0000दनांक \n25 \nनवंबर\n,\n \n2016\n \nक\u0000 ि\u0000 थ\n\u0000त के अनुसार\n,\n \nरबी फसल\u0000 का\n \nकुल \n\u0000े\u0000 \n327.62\n \nलाख है\u0000 टे\nयर था\n,\n \nजो \u0000पछले वष\u0000 क\u0000 संगत अव\u0000ध के दौरान \n313.17\n \nलाख \nहै\u0000 टे\nयर \u0000े\u0000 कवरेज क\u0000 त ुलना म\u0000 अ\u0000धक था। तथा\u0000प\n,\n \nये आंकडे\n़\n अनुमा\u0000न\nत\n \nएवं\n \nरा\u0000 य\u0000\n \n \n\u0000वारा \nने\n\u0000\n \nआं\nकलन पर आधा\u0000रत थे। \n \n \nदेश म\u0000 \nएक\n \nकृ\u0000ष वष\u0000 म\u0000 \u0000म ुख कृ\u0000ष फसल\u0000 के \u0000े\u0000\n,\n \nउ\u0000 पा\nदन और पैदावार का \u0000 या\nपक \nआकलन सम\u0000 \u0000प \nसे\n \nखर\u0000फ तथा रबी मौसम के \u0000लए \u0000कया जाता है। \n2016\n-\n17 \nके \u0000लए \nतीसरे अ\u0000\u0000म अन ुमान\u0000 के अन ुसार\n,\n \nरबी \n2016\n-\n17\n \nहेतु \u0000मुख कृ\u0000ष फसल\u0000 का अन ुमा\u0000नत \n\u0000े\u0000 कवरेज \n629.81\n \nलाख है\u0000 टे\nयर था जो \u0000पछले वष\u0000 के दौरान \n612\n.\n37 \nलाख \nहै\u0000 टे\nयर था। \nरबी \u0000े\u0000 के अधीन अ\u0000धक कवरेज यह दशा\u0000ता है \u0000क \u0000वम ु\u0000\u0000करण का रबी ब ुआई पर कोई \nमह\u0000 व\nपूण\u0000 \u0000वपर\u0000त \u0000भाव नह\u0000ं पड़ा है।\n \n*****\n ",
    "ls|LS16_S12_U_428": " \n \nGOVERNMENT OF INDIA\n \nMINISTRY OF AGRICULTURE AND FARMERS WELFARE\n \nDEPARTMENT OF AGRICULTURE, COOPERATION AND FARMERS WELFARE\n \n \nLOK  SABHA\n \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO.\n428\n                     \n \nTO BE ANSWERED ON THE  \n1\n8\nTH\n \nJULY\n, 2017\n \n \n     \nASSISTANCE TO COCONUT \nFARMERS\n \n \n428. \n \nSHRI PR. SENTHIL\n \nNATHAN:\n \n \nWill the Minister of AGRICULTURE AND FARMERS WELFARE\n \n  \n‡ãðŠãäÓã \nएवं \n\u0000कसान \nक\u0000याण \n½ãâ¨ããè\n \nbe pleased to state:\n \n \n \n(a) \n \nthe steps taken by the Government\n \nto support and encourage coconut farmers\n \nin \nthe country; and \n \n \n(b) \n \nthe details of the funds allocated\n \nto Tamil Nadu during the last five years for\n \nthe \ncoconut farmers?\n \n \nANSWER\n \n \nMINISTER OF  STATE IN THE  MINISTRY OF  AGRICULTURE AND  FARMERS  WELFARE\n \n \n‡ãðŠãäÓã  \nएवं \n\u0000कसान \nक\u0000याण \n½ãâ¨ããÊã¾ã ½ãñâ Àã•¾ã ½ãâ¨ããè          \n \n( SHRI \nPARSHOTTAM RUPALA)  \n \n \n(a):\n \nCoconut Development Board is implementing the following \nS\nchemes through \nwhich financial and technical support is extended to encourage farmers in the country \nfor coconut farming:\n-\n \n \n1. \nProduction and Distribution of Planting Material\n \n \ni\n.\n \nEstablishment of Demonstration cum Seed Production Farms and \nC\nommercial \nN\nurseries\n \nii\n.\n \nEstablishment of Regional Coconut Nurseries for coconut se\nedling production \n \niii\n.\n \nEstablishment of Nucleus Seed Garden \n \niv\n.\n \nEstablishment of Small \nC\noconut \nN\nurseries \n \n \n2.   \nExpansion of Area under Coconut\n \n3. \nIntegrated Farming for Productivity Improvement\n \nfor promotion of \nscientific \nmanagement practices i.e.\n \n \n           \ni. Laying out of Demonstration Plots  for productivity   improvement\n \n           \nii. Establishment of Organic Manure Units\n \n\n \n \nContd…2/\n-\n \n \n-\n2\n-\n \n \n \n \n \n4. \nReplanting and Rejuvenation of Coconut Gardens\n,\n \n \n5.\nTechnology \nMission on Coconut for promoting processing and \nproduct diversification,\n \n \n6. Publicity, Extension and \nMarket Promotional activities and Export \nPromotion Council \nfor exports and\n \n \n \n7. Facilitati\non of formation of Farmer Producers’ Organizations.\n \n \n(b):\n \nThe details of funds allocated to Tamil Nadu during last five years under various \nschemes by Coconut Development Board are given below:\n-\n \n \nYear\n \nFund Allocated \n \n(Rs.in lakh)\n \n2012\n-\n13\n \n513.79\n \n2013\n-\n14\n \n511.73\n \n2014\n-\n15\n \n543.78\n \n2015\n-\n16\n \n1190.29\n \n2016\n-\n17\n \n3247.26\n \nTotal\n \n6006.85\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n*****\n ",
    "ls|LS16_S12_U_429": " \nGOVERNMENT OF INDIA\n \nMINISTRY OF AGRICULTURE AND FARMERS WELFARE\n \nDEPARTMENT OF AGRICULTURE, COOPERATION AND FARMERS WELFARE\n \n \nLOK  SABHA\n \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO.\n429\n                     \n \nTO BE ANSWERED ON THE  \n1\n8\nTH\n \nJULY\n, 2017\n \n \n      \nINCREASING MSP FOR \nAGRICULTURAL PRODUCE\n \n \n429. \n \nSHRIMATI V. SATHYA\n \nBAMA:\n \n \nWill the Minister of AGRICULTURE AND FARMERS WELFARE\n \n  \n‡ãðŠãäÓã \nएवं \n\u0000कसान \nक\u0000याण \n½ãâ¨ããè\n \nbe pleased to state:\n \n \n \n(a) \n \nthe effective steps taken by the\n \nGovernment to increase the Minimum\n \nSupport \nPrice \n(MSP) for agricultural\n \nproducts, foodgrains, vegetables and fruits,\n \npulses, edible \noils;\n \n \n(b) \n \nwhether the Government has\n \nconstituted any committee to analyze and\n \nassess \nthe fixing of MSPs for such\n \nagricultural goods; and\n \n \n(c) \n \nif so, the decision taken by\n \nthe\n \nCommittee during the last two years for\n \nfixation of \nMSP for such agricultural\n \nproducts in the country?\n \n \nANSWER\n \n \nMINISTER OF  STATE IN THE  MINISTRY OF  AGRICULTURE AND  FARMERS  WELFARE\n \n \n‡ãðŠãäÓã  \nएवं \n\u0000कसान \nक\u0000याण \n½ãâ¨ããÊã¾ã ½ãñâ Àã•¾ã ½ãâ¨ããè          \n \n( SHRI\n \nS.S. \nAHLUWALIA\n)  \n \n \n(a)\n \nto (c)\n:\n \nGovernment fixes Minimum Support Price (MSP) for the major agricultural \nproduce on the recommendation of the Commission for Agricultural Costs & Prices \n(CACP), views of the State\n \nGovernments, concerned central Ministries/Departments \nand other relevant factors. \n \n \nMSPs are fixed for those agricultural crops which grown widely, large area under \ncultivation, items of mass consumption with fairly long shelf life and necessary for \nmaintaining food security. For Agricultural and Horticultural commodities which are not  \nc\novered under MSP, Government implements  Market Intervention Scheme (MIS) on \nthe request of the State Government.\n \nCommission for Agricultural Costs & Prices (CACP), which is an independent \nbody of experts, recommends Minimum Support Prices for the major ag\nricultural \nproduce each year. The MSPs recommended are based on consideration of variety of \nfactors that include cost of cultivation, trends in market prices, demand and supply \nsituation, effect on general price level, effect on cost of living etc. One of \nthe primary \nfactors considered by CACP is the cost of production.\n \n \nMSPs and Fair and Remunerative Prices (FRP) for Sugarcane\n \nfixed by the \n Government since 2015 - 16 are at Annexure.  \n\n \n \n \nAnnexure\n \n \nAnnexure referred to in reply to parts (a) to (c) of Lok Sabha Unstarred Question No.429 for answer on \n18.07.2017 \n \n \n                                                   \nM I N I M U M      S U P P O R T      P R I C E S \n \nIncluding Bonus\n \nAccording to crop \nyear\n                                          \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \nRs per quintal\n \n(As on 07.06.2017)\n \nSl. No.\n \nCommodity\n \nVariety \n \n2015\n-\n16\n \n2016\n-\n17\n \n2017\n-\n18\n \n \n \nKHARIF CROPS\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n1\n \nPADDY\n \nCommon\n \n1410\n \n1470\n \n1550\n \n \n \n \n \nGrade 'A'\n \n1450\n \n1510\n \n1590\n \n2\n \nJOWAR\n \nHybrid\n \n1570\n \n1625\n \n1700\n \n \n \n \n \nMaldandi\n \n1590\n \n1650\n \n1725\n \n3\n \nBAJRA\n \n \n \n1275\n \n1330\n \n1425\n \n4\n \nMAIZE\n \n \n \n1325\n \n1365\n \n1425\n \n5\n \nRAGI\n \n \n \n1650\n \n1725\n \n1900\n \n6\n \nARHAR(Tur)\n \n \n \n4625^\n \n5050^^\n \n5450^\n \n7\n \nMOONG\n \n \n \n4850^\n \n5225^^\n \n5575^\n \n8\n \nURAD\n \n \n \n4625^\n \n5000^^\n \n5400^\n \n9\n \nCOTTON \n \nMedium \nStaple\n \n3800\n \n3860\n \n4020\n \n \n \n \n \nLong Staple\n \n4100\n \n4160\n \n4320\n \n10\n \nGROUNDNUT IN SHELL\n \n \n \n4030\n \n4220*\n \n4450^\n \n11\n \nSUNFLOWER SEED\n \n \n \n3800\n \n3950*\n \n4100*\n \n12\n \nSOYABEAN\n \n \n \n2600\n \n2775*\n \n3050^\n \n13\n \nSESAMUM\n \n \n \n4700\n 